# Maintainer: Patrick Quinn <patrick@jquinn.com>
# WPE WebKit for Pacific, Marathon's browser. Alpine dropped wpewebkit in
# 2025; this follows its last recipe and webkit2gtk-6.0's, at the version
# and feature set Pacific's engine uses (shoal/pacific/engine/build/
# atlantic-wpe-features.cmake), with its patches: Atlantic's stack and
# Pacific's own (shoal/pacific/engine/build/patches, as pacific-*.patch).
